Yeah, sorry.

3854
04:04:35,120 --> 04:04:35,280
Listen.

3855
04:04:41,330 --> 04:04:46,570
I mean, I was just, you know, entrenched or enchanted by your conversation.

3856
04:04:49,110 --> 04:04:51,910
Can't that man, you know, drop some eaves here and there?

3857
04:04:54,190 --> 04:04:54,930
Heat cleared!

3858
04:04:57,090 --> 04:04:59,570
