3859
04:05:00,530 --> 04:05:01,110
Let's see.

3860
04:05:03,350 --> 04:05:03,770
Nice.

3861
04:05:04,710 --> 04:05:05,910
Let's go get the bike.

3862
04:05:06,790 --> 04:05:08,130
The quest for the bike.

3863
04:05:13,490 --> 04:05:15,350
Man, there's just so much happening.

3864
04:05:16,190 --> 04:05:17,850
This game is, like, crazy.

3865
04:05:18,410 --> 04:05:20,930
And it feels like I've barely even started the game.

3866
04:05:21,790 --> 04:05:24,270
There's so many, like, conversations happening everywhere.

3867
04:05:24,490 --> 04:05:25,730
The city looks amazing.

3868
04:05:27,270 --> 04:05:29,510
And I feel like I've barely been doing anything.

3869
04:05:29,510 --> 04:05:33,410
And yet, you know, it's been so dense and so fun.

3870
04:05:34,610 --> 04:05:35,090
Already.

3871
04:05:39,510 --> 04:05:40,270
What was that?

3872
04:05:42,590 --> 04:05:43,970
Did someone just scream at us?

3873
04:05:44,970 --> 04:05:45,690
Okay, whatever.

3874
04:05:50,150 --> 04:05:54,370
I wonder if there's like a way to turn on different lights here.

3875
04:05:58,970 --> 04:05:59,430
Oh!

3876
04:06:01,010 --> 04:06:02,370
You can put a blinker on!

3877
04:06:04,090 --> 04:06:04,550
What?

3878
04:06:08,490 --> 04:06:09,530
What was that?

3879
04:06:15,050 --> 04:06:17,030
Fuck you.

3880
04:06:17,210 --> 04:06:18,210
