Can I call the cops or an ambulance, maybe?

3905
04:07:16,350 --> 04:07:19,470
That's what happens when you mess with JV.

3906
04:07:22,270 --> 04:07:23,590
No, JD, I guess.

3907
04:07:24,110 --> 04:07:26,290
I can't even do acronyms.

3908
04:07:27,590 --> 04:07:28,050
See ya?

3909
04:07:28,110 --> 04:07:28,250
Wait.

3910
04:07:30,670 --> 04:07:32,310
Why is there a corpse in the middle of the street?

3911
04:07:34,310 --> 04:07:35,170
I didn't do that.

3912
04:07:36,150 --> 04:07:36,990
That wasn't me.

3913
04:07:38,430 --> 04:07:38,870
Anyway.

3914
04:07:39,490 --> 04:07:42,390
What I was trying to say before this all happened... I can have blinkers!

3915
04:07:42,570 --> 04:07:42,990
Look!

3916
04:07:45,170 --> 04:07:46,090
That's neat, isn't it?

3917
04:07:48,630 --> 04:07:49,690
The details, man.

3918
04:07:49,910 --> 04:07:50,870
I'm in love with them.

3919
04:07:54,330 --> 04:07:56,990
Someone got stopped there again by the cops.

3920
04:08:11,400 --> 04:08:12,980
If only I could hear the radio, huh?

3921
04:08:14,580 --> 04:08:14,900
Okay.

3922
04:08:15,540 --> 04:08:16,140
Question, though.

3923
04:08:16,260 --> 04:08:23,880
If we can pick up that bike and put it in the trunk of this car, then this is truly already the best Grand Theft Auto.

3924
04:08:25,040 --> 04:08:26,700
That's what's going to decide this right now.

3925
04:08:34,610 --> 04:08:35,870
Something's happening in those woods.

3926
04:08:36,010 --> 04:08:37,610
That's the second time I've seen someone come out of there.

3927
04:08:39,450 --> 04:08:40,550
What are they doing in there?

3928
04:08:43,310 --> 04:08:44,730
Don't tell me they recognized me.

3929
04:08:47,210 --> 04:08:48,330
Is my bike still here?

3930
04:08:49,670 --> 04:08:50,690
My bike is gone.

3931
04:08:52,210 --> 04:08:52,610
No.

3932
04:08:54,750 --> 04:08:56,210
Maybe it spawned back at home.

3933
04:08:58,850 --> 04:08:59,570
Wait a sec.

3934
04:09:01,700 --> 04:09:03,640
There's a wank scan nearby.

3935
04:09:04,060 --> 04:09:07,560
When in range, hold up to open the wanks app and scan it.

3936
04:09:08,360 --> 04:09:09,320
What do you mean?

3937
04:09:09,720 --> 04:09:10,240
That one?

3938
04:09:13,280 --> 04:09:15,400
Okay, but why is that important?

3939
04:09:17,220 --> 04:09:18,960
SUV, good condition.

3940
04:09:22,480 --> 04:09:23,760
For stealing, maybe.

3941
04:09:27,520 --> 04:09:29,280
I just want to look at this city here.

3942
04:09:45,980 --> 04:09:48,220
She's just chilling out there with a can of beer.

3943
04:10:05,100 --> 04:10:06,600
Whoa, look at that over there.

3944
04:10:08,040 --> 04:10:08,840
Skyscrapers and stuff.

3945
04:10:09,540 --> 04:10:10,260
The inner city.

3946
04:10:12,260 --> 04:10:16,780
I also have a statue here of a... Is that a kingfisher?

3947
04:10:19,000 --> 04:10:20,180
It may be, actually.

3948
04:10:23,560 --> 04:10:25,260
Okay, let's get the car and get out of here.

3949
04:10:28,280 --> 04:10:28,860
Get in.

3950
04:10:32,060 --> 04:10:33,040
Alright, back again.

3951
04:10:37,800 --> 04:10:39,440
God, the driving feels so good.

3952
04:10:40,200 --> 04:10:42,020
It took a little getting used to at first.

3953
04:10:42,220 --> 04:10:44,820
It was very sensitive, but now I'm really digging it, you know?

3954
04:10:54,090 --> 04:10:54,830
Oh, shit.

3955
04:10:57,070 --> 04:10:58,930
Sorry about that, brother.

3956
04:11:01,310 --> 04:11:04,290
I wonder if the cops will come after me for traffic violations.

3957
04:11:07,150 --> 04:11:07,950
Probably not.

3958
04:11:10,430 --> 04:11:11,110
Come on.

3959
04:11:12,930 --> 04:11:13,930
Move it, asshole.

3960
04:11:23,410 --> 04:11:25,490
I understand how road rage is a thing.

3961
04:11:26,690 --> 04:11:31,050
Like, just, you know, getting angry at other drivers in the video game.

3962
04:11:31,890 --> 04:11:32,890
Should tell you enough.

3963
04:11:35,430 --> 04:11:36,210
I understand.

3964
04:11:48,700 --> 04:11:51,660
We're gonna have to progress the story a little bit here, I think.

3965
04:11:54,320 --> 04:11:57,380
But I love that whole mission with Mandy and that.

3966
04:11:58,120 --> 04:11:59,100
That was so good.

3967
04:12:00,760 --> 04:12:01,620
What's happening here?

3968
04:12:06,360 --> 04:12:07,760
Look at the way these lights, though.

3969
04:12:08,840 --> 04:12:09,440
What's happening?

3970
04:12:13,640 --> 04:12:14,700
Oh, he's on the phone.

3971
04:12:24,290 --> 04:12:29,390
It is so satisfying, guys, to just cruise through the city here.

3972
04:12:37,270 --> 04:12:38,890
Let me overtake these assholes.

3973
04:12:40,710 --> 04:12:41,790
A little too slow.

3974
04:12:43,090 --> 04:12:44,710
I'm gonna try and steal a truck soon.

3975
04:12:45,870 --> 04:12:46,850
I wanna drive that.

3976
04:12:46,910 --> 04:12:47,850
I wanna drive all the vehicles.

3977
04:13:00,700 --> 04:13:02,760
CSL, Coastal Shipping Logistics.

3978
04:13:05,620 --> 04:13:07,000
Oh, you know what I could do?

3979
04:13:07,640 --> 04:13:08,960
I could text and drive.

3980
04:13:13,080 --> 04:13:15,080
That system is actually so beautiful.

3981
04:13:21,900 --> 04:13:23,100
I went too far, didn't I?

3982
04:13:23,300 --> 04:13:24,280
I went way too far.

3983
04:13:24,560 --> 04:13:25,160
But you know what?

3984
04:13:25,180 --> 04:13:25,520
That's okay.

3985
04:13:25,840 --> 04:13:26,480
We can go do this.

3986
04:13:27,940 --> 04:13:30,060
Fixing the car is something Lucia will appreciate.

3987
04:13:31,380 --> 04:13:33,360
And is the thing I'm driving now the Ganado?

3988
04:13:35,340 --> 04:13:36,780
It says Vapid on the back.

3989
04:13:40,280 --> 04:13:42,340
I'm gonna assume that it is the Ganado.

3990
04:13:44,560 --> 04:13:45,360
Oh, wait, wait, wait.

3991
04:13:45,480 --> 04:13:49,060
No, they're probably talking about... the red one.

3992
04:13:54,660 --> 04:13:55,520
Let me just go in here.

3993
04:13:57,140 --> 04:13:58,240
See if they're open right now.

3994
04:14:00,180 --> 04:14:00,500
Hey!

3995
04:14:08,690 --> 04:14:09,290
What's up, Joey?

3996
04:14:31,400 --> 04:14:33,220
I'm gonna tell you the same thing I tell Donnie.

3997
04:14:33,400 --> 04:14:34,680
Let's keep this thing reciprocal.

3998
04:14:34,960 --> 04:14:35,900
I'll get her back in shape.

3999
04:14:36,080 --> 04:14:37,020
On me this time.

4000
04:14:37,140 --> 04:14:38,800
Long as next time you bust it up.

4001
04:14:39,020 --> 04:14:39,720
And trust, brother.

4002
04:14:40,160 --> 04:14:42,100
With y'all, there's gonna be a next time.

4003
04:14:42,360 --> 04:14:43,680
You bring your business here.

4004
04:14:44,060 --> 04:14:45,180
How's that sound to you?

4005
04:14:45,260 --> 04:14:45,560
Sure.

4006
04:14:46,060 --> 04:14:46,440
Yeah, deal.

4007
04:14:46,660 --> 04:14:50,140
Oh, I got some bearings for that 7-liter in the back if you want to get it running smooth.

4008
04:14:50,540 --> 04:14:51,900
I can knock a few bucks off.

4009
04:14:52,040 --> 04:14:52,840
Lick of paint, too.

4010
04:14:53,020 --> 04:14:53,320
Sweet.

4011
04:14:53,520 --> 04:14:53,780
Thanks.

4012
04:14:54,420 --> 04:14:54,920
Go ahead.

4013
04:14:55,100 --> 04:14:55,960
Pull up in the shop.

4014
04:14:58,520 --> 04:14:59,460
Okay, okay.

4015
04:14:59,860 --> 04:15:00,860
So this was the Ganado.

4016
04:15:01,020 --> 04:15:03,760
I also noticed it does say Ganado on the side there.

4017
04:15:10,040 --> 04:15:11,380
Honestly, kind of a cool car.

4018
04:15:12,700 --> 04:15:13,560
I feel it.

4019
04:15:14,540 --> 04:15:15,300
Repair for free.

4020
04:15:15,520 --> 04:15:17,740
You'll need to repair your vehicle before making modifications.

4021
04:15:18,020 --> 04:15:18,340
Yes.

4022
04:15:26,000 --> 04:15:26,900
Oh, wait.

4023
04:15:27,000 --> 04:15:27,760
This is so satisfying.

4024
04:15:29,300 --> 04:15:30,080
Engine upgrade.

4025
04:15:30,320 --> 04:15:31,160
Oh, that's going to cost me.

4026
04:15:31,360 --> 04:15:31,400
Okay.

4027
04:15:32,980 --> 04:15:33,740
Wait a minute.

4028
04:15:33,880 --> 04:15:34,760
I thought you said it was free.

4029
04:15:36,600 --> 04:15:38,200
Oh, the repair was free, I guess.

4030
04:15:38,460 --> 04:15:39,500
Now this is going to cost.

4031
04:15:44,120 --> 04:15:44,440
Okay.

4032
04:15:49,320 --> 04:15:50,280
I'll take you up on that.

4033
04:15:54,130 --> 04:15:55,470
Ooh, it's looking brand new!

4034
04:15:57,190 --> 04:16:00,190
But I feel like it's just hiding the problems here.

4035
04:16:00,350 --> 04:16:01,270
It's covering it up, you know?

4036
04:16:04,470 --> 04:16:05,470
It's gotta be red.

4037
04:16:07,270 --> 04:16:07,630
Right?

4038
04:16:13,160 --> 04:16:13,740
